{"id":"c8d70fc96898bee6","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-principal-code.md","title":"任意相对全函数编码进等度集合的主函数","display":"lem-principal-code — 任意相对全函数编码进等度集合的主函数","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-principal-code","aliases":["20-lem-principal-code"],"display":"lem-principal-code — 任意相对全函数编码进等度集合的主函数","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.6.2 的主函数编码补写","source_printed_pages":[124,125],"source_pdf_pages":[159,160],"depends_on":["[[20-df-principal-function]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-teq]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-principal-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-principal-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-principal-code — 任意相对全函数编码进等度集合的主函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.6.2 的主函数编码补写"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span><span>160</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"145fee39d6716fb8\" href=\"?note=145fee39d6716fb8\" title=\"20-df-principal-function\">20-df-principal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\le_T A\">\\(f\\le_T A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"145fee39d6716fb8\" href=\"?note=145fee39d6716fb8\" title=\"20-df-principal-function\">20-df-principal-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}principal-code}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\subseteq\\omega\\ [|C|=\\omega\\land C\\equiv_T A\\land\\forall n\\ p_C(n+1)&gt;f(n)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}principal-code}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\subseteq\\omega\\ [|C|=\\omega\\land C\\equiv_T A\\land\\forall n\\ p_C(n+1)&gt;f(n)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(0)=0\">\\(g(0)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(n+1)=g(n)+2f(n)+\\chi_A(n)+1\">\\(g(n+1)=g(n)+2f(n)+\\chi_A(n)+1\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\">\\(C=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\)</span>。严格递增和无界使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 无限且可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 判定成员：算到首个不小于候选数的位置。反向从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 列出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，相邻差减 1 的奇偶恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，除以 2 的商恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_C=g\">\\(p_C=g\\)</span>，从递推立即得到不等式。递归按自然数良基，所有值有限。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.2 的主函数编码补写；印刷页 124, 125；PDF 第 159, 160 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-principal-function","status":"resolved","id":"145fee39d6716fb8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-principal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-teq]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-principal-function","status":"resolved","id":"145fee39d6716fb8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-teq]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f\\le_T A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}principal-code}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\subseteq\\omega\\ [|C|=\\omega\\land C\\equiv_T A\\land\\forall n\\ p_C(n+1)>f(n)].","display":true},{"tex":"g(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"g(n+1)=g(n)+2f(n)+\\chi_A(n)+1","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\operatorname{ran}(g)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"p_C=g","display":false}],"bytes":1576,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee204c4a529582bb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-lem-principal-code]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-principal-code]] — 章 5；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-principal-code]]"}],"outgoing":["145fee39d6716fb8","de14d8d6c42250de","140cce30ee9c16d1","3dd87